OL,3,GNEWSAWhale pod spotted in Thames is
OL,4,A'highly unusual'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhales have been spotted in the Thames
OL,7,FEstuary in a "highly unusual" sighting.
OL,9,FBritish Divers Marine Life Rescue
OL,10,F(BDMLR) said it was called after
OL,11,Freports that 25 long-finned pilot
OL,12,Fwhales were seen close to Coalhouse
OL,13,FFort at East Tilbury and at Tilbury in
OL,14,FEssex on Thursday.
OL,16,FTheir presence in the Thames and the
OL,17,Fsouthern North Sea was uncommon, added
OL,18,Fthe spokesperson.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
