OL,3,GNEWSAWhale pod spotted in Thames is
OL,4,A'highly unusual'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Port of London Authority spokesperson
OL,7,Fsaid: "There is currently a pod of
OL,8,Fpilot whales in the tidal Thames, near
OL,9,FGravesend. They are a wonderful sight
OL,10,Fbut this is not the usual environment
OL,11,Ffor them, so we hope they will soon be
OL,12,Fable to find their way back out to sea.
OL,13,F"
